    "root_cause": "Narrative TTS can execute while the same native stage is resident for the voice lane. The harness lease count can reach zero while an accepted native request's final success terminal remains in its outbox. RawTap records a terminal only after forwarding it to the Coordinator, and both failed requests show process shutdown 80-100 ms after the last forwarded PCM chunk but before that terminal.",
    "fix": "Before every live TTS-to-other-stage process switch, wait until every submitted native TTS request id has a forwarded complete terminal. The barrier uses the existing request timeout only as a fail-closed harness limit and records compact drain counts; it never changes public or client deadlines.",
